 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the figure to find a circuit that fits the description.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/33e9222b049123c6.png\" alt=\"Two graphs. Graph P has seven vertices labeled a to g. The edges connect a b, b e, a e, b c, b d, d f, e f, e d, d c, f c, c g, and f g. Graph Q has 7 vertices labeled h, i, j, k, n, m, and o. The edges connect h i, h k, k n, i n, i j, j n, n m, m i, j m, i k, j m, m o, and o k.\">\n",
